{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll the dice, but make your own luck in this 2D dice-building roguelike. Draft spells, modify your dice for maximum synergy, defeat challenging enemies, and conquer the Archon's palace.  Make every choice count, and prove your worth to the Soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Modify Your Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/ModifyDice.gif?t=1750351537\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RNG in dice games can be less than fun... but fortunately for you, you can stack the dice in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Draft Powerful Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/DraftSpells.gif?t=1750351537\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the Gaiamancer, the Pyromancer, or the Thaumancer (or even a secret fourth character). Each mage has their own unique spells to choose from, over 200 spells in total! But spells alone won't be enough to get you through the palace to find the Archon Soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synergize Your Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/SynergizeDice.gif?t=1750351537\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to changing the face values of your dice, you can also modify them with Dice Bodies and Runes to add synergies with your spells along with other interesting abilities. With 40 runes and over 30 dice bodies, each dice has over 65,000 combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Conquer the Archon's Palace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/DefeatEnemies.gif?t=1750351537\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Archon's palace, choose your path, engage in combat, encounter events, defeat powerful bosses, and fight your way through 4(?) acts to make your way to the Archon Soul. Can you prove your worth to the Soul, and become one with its power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill testing and strategic roguelike gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable characters to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 dice runes and over 30 dice bodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of unique enemies to challenge your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful illustrated artwork by Anais Lehoux and Natalya Samutina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric soundtrack by Ofelia Argiro</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799470?t=1750351537","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/87e09cbd6a011a92d722e8f77f084a4215783979/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750351537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/f4480894ed4495215df317b9d880ce591536961a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750351537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/f4480894ed4495215df317b9d880ce591536961a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750351537","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll the dice, but make your own luck in this 2D dice-building roguelike. Draft spells, modify your dice for maximum synergy, defeat challenging enemies, and conquer the Archon's palace.  Make every choice count, and prove your worth to the Soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Modify Your Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/ModifyDice.gif?t=1750351537\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RNG in dice games can be less than fun... but fortunately for you, you can stack the dice in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Draft Powerful Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/DraftSpells.gif?t=1750351537\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the Gaiamancer, the Pyromancer, or the Thaumancer (or even a secret fourth character). Each mage has their own unique spells to choose from, over 200 spells in total! But spells alone won't be enough to get you through the palace to find the Archon Soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synergize Your Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/SynergizeDice.gif?t=1750351537\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to changing the face values of your dice, you can also modify them with Dice Bodies and Runes to add synergies with your spells along with other interesting abilities. With 40 runes and over 30 dice bodies, each dice has over 65,000 combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Conquer the Archon's Palace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/extras/DefeatEnemies.gif?t=1750351537\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Archon's palace, choose your path, engage in combat, encounter events, defeat powerful bosses, and fight your way through 4(?) acts to make your way to the Archon Soul. Can you prove your worth to the Soul, and become one with its power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill testing and strategic roguelike gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 playable characters to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 dice runes and over 30 dice bodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of unique enemies to challenge your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful illustrated artwork by Anais Lehoux and Natalya Samutina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric soundtrack by Ofelia Argiro</p></li></ul>","developers":["PolyGryph"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799470/ed5d93b2a6ec67b42f4e5de6fea741efe2abc78e/header.jpg?t=1750351537","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156139,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156139/movie480.mp4?t=1750281477","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156139/movie_max.mp4?t=1750281477"},"name":"Archon Soul - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steams